      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I strongly agree. \nIt is super annoying when you find a nice spot in a beautiful world to take a picture, but you can't get too close to the wall because then the avatar freezes. \nOr when you're in front of a table that has colliders, you want to reach over it to grab something, but your hand dies because your hip gets too close to the table collider. \nA suggestion would maybe be, to simply make the avatar freeze a little bit later? Like giving it a good half meter more distance inside the collider until it freezes, or something like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
